{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114644","id":3784323745,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67rcrV","number":114644,"title":"Reduction of TAA jitter positions for better motion clarity and reduced ghosting.","user":{"login":"blendegames","id":175467813,"node_id":"U_kgDOCnVtJQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175467813?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames","html_url":"https://github.com/blendegames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blendegames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-06T09:00:26Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:09:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114644","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114644.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114644.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is a basic 2 jitter position implementation that doesn't do any major changes to the current TAA implementation for now. In the scenes I was able to test, most of the issues present with the current TAA implementation are gone.\r\n\r\nHere are some examples:\r\nVideos:\r\nLight ball test ([#68343](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68343)):\r\nMaster: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5be4bfd3-4d3d-488a-bfe9-fe47f847a7bb\r\nMy fork: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d42003e-906f-4c76-80c1-e00f63a5c572\r\nThere is an improvement to the artifacting around the movable sphere, but there is an increase in aliasing since there is way less jitter positions.\r\n\r\nFSR test ([#111631](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631#issuecomment-3402282988)):\r\nMaster: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f3d1ca8-d6c6-4e49-bd69-f9508177963e\r\nMy fork: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc911f9c-c411-4126-9513-ab0fbc6199f5\r\nLess jitter is noticeable in certain areas of the scene.\r\n\r\nThin geometry test:\r\nMaster: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23efbdb2-41fb-4cc8-b5ec-3e8e4ad9f4b\r\nMy fork: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bb9b66f-30a8-4aec-84cb-a50b828765a2\r\nThe thin object is a lot less blurry and ghosting is almost non existent.\r\n\r\nScreenshots:\r\nLight ball test ([#68343](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68343)):\r\nMaster:\r\n<img width=\"537\" height=\"506\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 033003\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3461b6ea-85b5-420e-ab45-b5c070c6a2da\" />\r\nMy fork:\r\n<img width=\"506\" height=\"522\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 033131\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5788862-e474-49b4-8db5-6e5d5f038ad7\" />\r\nEven when I'm not moving the ball around the scene, I get an improvement in sharpness.\r\n\r\nFSR test ([#111631](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111631#issuecomment-3402282988)):\r\nMotion is needed to see the difference, no screenshots needed.\r\n\r\nThin geometry test:\r\nMaster:\r\n<img width=\"494\" height=\"877\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 032722\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bcd50e1a-1f9b-4f3e-8f45-e1b14f1fe9b1\" />\r\nMy fork:\r\n<img width=\"449\" height=\"885\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-06 032757\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a53c0c5b-8b03-4635-a52d-b5222a5eb27c\" />\r\nThe ghosting is barely noticeable if not completely gone and the object looks less blurry.\r\n\r\nThere is a caveat to all of this. There is a loss in anti-aliasing capability, but with the combination of other anti-aliasing techniques such as SMAA or FXAA, that issue can be mitigated. If someone wants to keep the previous TAA implementation, it might be possible to keep it when no other anti-aliasing solutions are turned on.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114644/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}